 "conclusion": "Project plateau = minimally coupled scalar with Starobinsky-shaped potential (v11 A4): the MMR 2021 field-theory criterion applies; MMR 2022 R^2 cross terms are absent. xi_inf(m_t) [xi_EW at mu=m_t] = 0.049/0.055/0.060 at m_t = 172.2/172.6/173.0 (alpha_s 0.1180). In the high-scale reading (xi at mu_b) 0.030/0.038/0.044 < xi_c(R2) 0.036/0.072/0.120: zero-mode condition is the stronger one for m_t >= 172.2 (crossover ~172.1 by extrapolation); in the EW reading inflation is stronger below ~172.4 GeV. Herranen 2015 upper window xi <~ 1 (3/8 robust) applies; xi_H = 1/6 allowed by all."
